      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $x^{2} + 2 x y=- 3 y - 18$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-6,-3)$\n- **II.** $(-6,6)$\n- **III.** $(-3,6)$\n- **IV.** $(3,-3)$\n- **V.** $(3,6)$\n- **VI.** $(-3,-3)$\n- **VII.** $(6,-6)$",
