      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $x^{2} + 2 x y=9 y + 20$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(4,-5)$\n- **II.** $(4,-4)$\n- **III.** $(2,-4)$\n- **IV.** $(5,-5)$\n- **V.** $(5,-4)$\n- **VI.** $(-5,-5)$\n- **VII.** $(-4,4)$",
