      ":question/id": "12be947a-aa46-5222-a6ac-9ea0afb54828",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $x^{2} + 2 x y=20 - 9 y$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-5,4)$\n- **II.** $(-5,5)$\n- **III.** $(- \\frac{5}{2},5)$\n- **IV.** $(-4,4)$\n- **V.** $(-4,5)$\n- **VI.** $(4,4)$\n- **VII.** $(5,-5)$",
